  "source": "Lovato Electric DMK40 Modbus RTU addendum (AHIT303, 20/02/2006)",
  "notes": [
    "Lovato DMK40. The first 50 measures of table 2 of the addendum (function 04, each an unsigned 32-bit value in two registers, high word first; up to 30 measures per request).",
    "The addendum says the address sent on the wire is the table address minus one, so this map uses address_base 1 with the table addresses.",
    "Units follow the table: currents are in A/100 (scale 0.01), frequency in Hz/10, energies in multiples of 100 Wh or 100 varh. The measures from 74 onwards in the table (averages of later items, maxima, harmonics, records) are partly not in this map.",
    "Power factor, cos phi and powers carry sign and type in the top bits of the value; see the description of those registers.",
    "Not tested on a device."
  ],
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 1,
